  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfSignificantTransactionsNotRequiringUseOfCashOrCashEquivalentsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;　２　重要な非資金取引の内容&lt;/p&gt;
